  unitName: Blazing Dragoon Ludero
  unitId: 11146
  unitNumber: 1715
  description: A heroic knight said to have defeated an evil demon dragon that had
    been resurrected in a distant world. Long ago when a demon dragon presumed dead
    came back to life, Ludero's master commanded him to vanquish the demon by using
    the Sacred Lance forged by the gods themselves. Legend has it that Ludero's battle
    against the powerful dragon lasted three days and three nights. The collision
    between the dragon's powers and those of the Sacred Lance is rumored to have
    warped time and space, and that both combatants disappeared without really concluding
    their duel.
  summonDesc: I have but one favor to ask...<br>Please command me to defeat evil.<br>That
    is all I require to fight.
  fusionDesc: Everyone, please lend me your power! I need all of your energy to protect
    our world!
